  - GOT IT
  - 'Welcome to the maze! Your goal is to find the exit.

    Move with WASD or the
    arrow keys and follow the glowing line.'
  - 'Welcome to the maze! Your goal is to find the exit.

    Move with the stick
    on the left and follow the glowing line.'
  - Follow the line
  - 'Some doors are locked. A key opens one door of its colour.

    To pick up a
    key, just step on it.'
  - Pick up the key
  - Go up to the door of the key's colour and press E to unlock it. The key is used
    up.
  - Go up to the door of the key's colour and press Use (the round button) to unlock
    it. The key is used up.
  - 'Unlock the door: E'
  - 'Unlock the door: Use'
  - The door is unlocked but still closed. Press E again to open it. Doors can be
    opened and closed any number of times.
  - The door is unlocked but still closed. Press Use again to open it. Doors can
    be opened and closed any number of times.
  - 'Open the door: E'
  - 'Open the door: Use'
  - 'Weapons lie on the floor. Stand on one and press E to take it.

    You can
    carry one melee weapon and one firearm.'
  - 'Weapons lie on the floor. Stand on one and press Use to take it.

    You can
    carry one melee weapon and one firearm.'
  - 'Take the weapon: E'
  - 'Take the weapon: Use'
  - 'A zombie is behind this door! The yellow cone shows what it sees: step into
    it and the zombie roars and attacks.

    Open the door and hit it with Space
    or the left mouse button.'
  - 'A zombie is behind this door! The yellow cone shows what it sees: step into
    it and the zombie roars and attacks.

    Open the door and hit it with the big
    Attack button on the right.'
  - 'Defeat the zombie: Space / left mouse button'
  - 'Defeat the zombie: Attack'
  - 'A firearm! It hits from afar, but the magazine is small: it reloads by itself
    when empty, or press R.

    Switch weapons with 1 and 2.'
  - 'A firearm! It hits from afar, but the magazine is small: it reloads by itself
    when empty, or tap its slot again.

    Switch weapons by tapping their slots
    around the Attack button.'
  - 'Take the gun: E'
  - 'Take the gun: Use'
  - 'Another zombie is down the corridor. This one sees nothing but hears well, and
    shots are loud: it will come to you.

    Shoot it before it gets close.'
  - Shoot the zombie
  - "Hurt? A medkit heals you to full.\nStep on it \u2014 it is used only when your
    health is not full."
  - Step on the medkit
  - Open the map with M or the map button at the top right. On the map, the magnifier
    shows the way to the nearest goal.
  - Open the map with the map button at the top right. On the map, the magnifier
